---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';

const updated = 'November 11, 2026';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy Policy for anagramGenerator: your text is processed in your browser and never sent to our servers.">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 md:py-24">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="display-xl mt-3 !text-4xl sm:!text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-mute">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <div class="mt-12 space-y-10">
      <section>
        <h2 class="heading-md">Summary</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-body">
          {SITE.name} runs in your browser. The words and phrases you enter are processed on your device and are not sent to or stored on our servers. The site does use Google Analytics and Google AdSense, which set cookies as described below.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="heading-md">Information we do not collect</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-body">
          We do not require accounts, and we do not ask for your name, email address or any other personal details to use the tool. The text you type into the generator never leaves the page. Our analytics and advertising partners may collect the technical data described below.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="heading-md">Data stored on your device</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-body">
          The site uses your browser’s local storage and cache to remember your theme preference, your search history and favorites, and to keep the downloaded dictionary so it loads faster next time. This data stays on your device, and you can clear it at any time through your browser settings.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="heading-md">Server logs and hosting</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-body">
          Like most websites, our hosting provider may keep standard server logs such as IP address, browser type and requested pages for security and reliability. We do not use these logs to identify individual visitors.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="heading-md">Analytics</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-body">
          We use Google Analytics to understand how the site is used, such as which pages are visited, roughly where visitors are located, and what device and browser they use. Google Analytics uses cookies and similar identifiers to collect this information. It does not receive the words or phrases you enter into the generator. You can opt out with the <a class="text-link underline-offset-2 hover:underline" href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="noopener">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>. Learn how Google handles this data in <a class="text-link underline-offset-2 hover:underline" href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener">How Google uses information from sites that use its services</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="heading-md">Advertising and cookies</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-body">
          We show ads served by Google AdSense. Google and its partners use cookies, including the DoubleClick cookie, to serve ads based on your previous visits to this and other websites. Google’s use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads based on your visit to our site and other sites on the internet.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-body">
          You can opt out of personalized advertising at <a class="text-link underline-offset-2 hover:underline" href="https://adssettings.google.com" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>, or opt out of some third-party vendors’ use of cookies for personalized advertising at <a class="text-link underline-offset-2 hover:underline" href="https://www.aboutads.info" rel="noopener">aboutads.info</a>. Where required, such as in the European Economic Area, the United Kingdom and Switzerland, we ask for your consent before setting advertising and analytics cookies, and you can change your choice at any time. You can also block or delete cookies in your browser settings, though some parts of the site may then work differently.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="heading-md">Third parties</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-body">
          Apart from Google Analytics and Google AdSense described above, we do not share your data with third parties, and we do not sell personal information. Links to other sites are governed by those sites’ own policies.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="heading-md">Children</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-body">
          The site is general-audience and does not knowingly collect personal information from anyone, including children.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="heading-md">Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-body">
          We may update this policy from time to time. The date above shows when it last changed.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="heading-md">Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-body">
          Questions about privacy? Email <a class="text-link underline-offset-2 hover:underline" href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a> or visit our <a class="text-link underline-offset-2 hover:underline" href="/contact">contact page</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
